               </title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Hydroxypropyl Cellulose, Hypromellose, Magnesium Stearate, Microcrystalline Cellulose, Polyethylene Glycol, Pregelatinized Starch, Sodium Starch Glycolate, Talc, Titanium Dioxide, Triacetin.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20260616"/>
            </section>
